> Hello,
>
> How can I install previous version of DEXSeq (1.6.0)?

The "most supported" way is to first install and be using the version
of R that is tied to the version of Bioconductor that DEXSeq v1.6.0
was built for.

It looks like DEXSeq 1.6.0 was for bioconductor 2.12:

http://bioconductor.org/packages/2.12/bioc/html/DEXSeq.html

Which I believe requires R-2.15.3

So, you would have to install and use R 2.15.3 then just install
DEXSeq via biocLite as usual.

HTH,

