Hi Jacob,

Yes, I see the issue.  The edgeR routines assume that y$samples$group 
doesn't have superfluous factor levels.  The culprit is:

  groups <- groups[sel_cols]

If you change this to

  groups <- factor(groups[sel_cols])

all will be well.

Best wishes
Gordon


