Normally any dependency you specify in your DESCRIPTION file will be installed by both the BioC and CRAN build machines. Because we didn't have Mavericks builds at the beginning of our devel cycle, Simon has been installing some packages by hand, and not installing others (such as packages in Suggests). Most BioC packages are now building on Mavericks, and I'll contact the maintainers of the remaining ones to see how we can get them green. It's better for all concerned if packages are installed automatically and we don't have to make special requests.

Dan


