Hi Monique,

If you want to put the phenoData into your AffyBatch, then you also need 
to add the protocolData as well. The simplest thing is to just create an 
empty protocolData object, and use that:

protocolData(mydata) <- new("AnnotatedDataFrame", data = 
data.frame(row.names = row.names(pData(mydata))))

Best,

Jim



