Subject: [BioC] Error in Data.frame for mogene10stv1cdf and
	mogene10sttranscriptcluster.db
In-Reply-To: <CFD46E47.C5F4%jzma@unimelb.edu.au>
References: <CFD46E47.C5F4%jzma@unimelb.edu.au>
